section Skinning 250-275

step Beasts 46-49 (250-275)
  tip Walk the loop and kill and skin Savage Owlbeast (46), Silvermane Stalker (47), Ravasaur (48), Ravasaur Hunter (49), Ravasaur Runner (49) until Skinning 275; loot each corpse, then skin it, and skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. The arrow takes the loop that gets you there soonest from where you are and walks it until the skill is reached; each loop keeps to creatures no more than a level above you and away from the other faction's towns, and the window names it and its lap. Expect about 30 beasts for these 25 points: about 20 Thick Leather and 10 Rugged Leather. For Leatherworking: about 615 Thick Leather and 975 Rugged Leather in all.
