# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Skinning 275-300
section Skinning 275-300

step Beasts 48-54 (275-300)
  tip Walk the loop and kill and skin Fledgling Pterrordax (48), Young Diemetradon (49), Un'Goro Gorilla (50), Un'Goro Stomper (51), Un'Goro Thunderer (52), Diseased Wolf (53), Ragged Owlbeast (53), Shardtooth Bear (53), Stonelash Scorpid (54) until Skinning 300; loot each corpse, then skin it, and skin the highest-level beasts your skill allows. A beast of level L needs skill (L-10)x10 up to level 20 and Lx5 above. The arrow takes the loop that gets you there soonest from where you are and walks it until the skill is reached; each loop keeps to creatures no more than a level above you and away from the other faction's towns, and the window names it and its lap. Expect about 30 beasts for these 25 points: about 15 Rugged Leather and 10 Thick Leather. For Leatherworking: about 975 Rugged Leather and 615 Thick Leather in all.
